  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You sear a burning demonic sigil onto a creature within range, which makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failure, it takes 3d10 Fire damage and is cursed; while it is cursed, you have Resistance to all the damage it deals. On a success, it takes half as much damage only.</p><p>A cursed creature repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on a success.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-c8fXrtINoX5UwNgL\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect marks the cursed creature; apply your Resistance to its damage by hand.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
